Package: m6APrediction
Title: Predict m6A Sites Using a Random Forest Model
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Yunnuo", "Zhang", email = "2495969897@qq.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to encode DNA sequences and predict
    m6A sites using a trained random forest model. Supports predictions
    for individual samples and multiple samples, with example data
    and a fitted model included.
